  "mechanism": "The existing archive owner treats only Payload(Storage(Generic)) as retryable through its original bounded fair lane. A subsequent attempt loads the same durable archive intent and reconstructs its existing ticket/publication. Full byte verification and exact payload pin/adoption reconciliation still precede coverage. No application callback is replayed by this archive owner.",
